  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7101602",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710160201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710160201": {
            "id": "710160201",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Regarding the Nameless Treasure...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160202"
            ]
          },
          "710160202": {
            "id": "710160202",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "This thing you've brought... It looks pretty good. This pattern also seems quite old indeed. Hold on while I open it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160203"
            ]
          },
          "710160203": {
            "id": "710160203",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "There are some defects here and there, but if you're eager to have it taken off your hands, I can offer you a price. It'll be fair, but it won't be high.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160204"
            ]
          },
          "710160204": {
            "id": "710160204",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "I just had a look at this one. These markings are definitely those of Liyue, and you can see inscribed here an anecdote about Azhdaha.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160205"
            ]
          },
          "710160205": {
            "id": "710160205",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "They say that Azhdaha was a dragon spawned by a convergence of the spirits of Geo in Liyue, and that even Rex Lapis could not easily subdue it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160206"
            ]
          },
          "710160206": {
            "id": "710160206",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Rex Lapis thus summoned three adepti to his aid, and together they created a cavernous realm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160207"
            ]
          },
          "710160207": {
            "id": "710160207",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Rex Lapis then battled the creature, luring it into the realm, before ordering the adepti to seal the entrance, trapping Azhdaha within.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160208"
            ]
          },
          "710160208": {
            "id": "710160208",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "The patterns on the thing you brought seem to describe the three adepti joining hands to create the cavernous realm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160209"
            ]
          },
          "710160209": {
            "id": "710160209",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "I guess that there should at least be three relics of this kind. Combining all three should give us the complete item.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160211",
              "710160213"
            ]
          },
          "710160211": {
            "id": "710160211",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Well, I do trade in items of all kinds. A little general knowledge here and there couldn't hurt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160215"
            ]
          },
          "710160215": {
            "id": "710160215",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Ah, but I digress. As I said earlier, there should be three of this item. One of them alone is likely not going to fetch a high price.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160216"
            ]
          },
          "710160216": {
            "id": "710160216",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "But if you could gather all three, that would be a different story. But this looks to be quite ancient. Gathering all three might be too tall a task..."
          },
          "710160213": {
            "id": "710160213",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Now this I'm not certain of, but a senior of mine once told me that Liyue is too large, and its history is, similarly, far too long.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160214"
            ]
          },
          "710160214": {
            "id": "710160214",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Don't be surprised if you find strange relics in Liyue. What we know of Liyue's lengthy history is but a single drop in the wide ocean."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101603",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710160501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710160501": {
            "id": "710160501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Found all three.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160502"
            ]
          },
          "710160502": {
            "id": "710160502",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "You... actually managed to put them together? Please, let me see... Indeed, these three patterns, when put together, do tell the story of Azhdaha.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160503"
            ]
          },
          "710160503": {
            "id": "710160503",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "This crane must be the adeptus Mountain Shaper, and this deer might be Moon Carver. But this last one...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160504"
            ]
          },
          "710160504": {
            "id": "710160504",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Eh? It seems like this pattern has been... intentionally ground away by someone, to the point where I can't make it out. Who was this third adeptus?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160505"
            ]
          },
          "710160505": {
            "id": "710160505",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Forget it. These matters are beyond my knowledge. Regardless, this treasure is complete, and will definitely sell well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160506"
            ]
          },
          "710160506": {
            "id": "710160506",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "So, would you like to take it for a keepsake, or would you prefer to sell it to me? I'll pay you a pretty sum.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160507"
            ]
          },
          "710160507": {
            "id": "710160507",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It's yours.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160508"
            ]
          },
          "710160508": {
            "id": "710160508",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Great. Please take this, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160509"
            ]
          },
          "710160509": {
            "id": "710160509",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Still, why was the image of one of the three adepti marred?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160510"
            ]
          },
          "710160510": {
            "id": "710160510",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Who made this thing, and who broke it and ground away the adeptus' image?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160511"
            ]
          },
          "710160511": {
            "id": "710160511",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Right, it seems as if Soraya has arrived in Liyue. I could write her a letter... she would definitely be interested in this object."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7101604",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710160401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710160401": {
            "id": "710160401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll give it a go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710160402"
            ]
          },
          "710160402": {
            "id": "710160402",
            "speakerId": 2023,
            "speakerName": "Linlang",
            "text": "Alright. If you do manage to gather them, please bring them to me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
